 "run-20261019-categories-remaining-p001-gpt61sol", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fadabac157b02ac87b90acebf9dcb3acea85a07760585d986c2629b6c802fb76", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "natural transformation", "target_term": "自然变换"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composing", "target_term": "合成"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "合成"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "transformations", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "合成"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "mathematical object", "target_term": "数学对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，给定态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>，它属于<MATH_0002>，便得到相应的函子（functors）间的自然变换（natural transformation）<MATH_0003>，它由与态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>合成（composing）定义。这把态射（morphisms）在<MATH_0005>中的合成（composition）变为函子（functors）间变换（transformations）的合成（composition）。换言之，我们得到一个函子（functor）\n<MATH_0006>\n注意，其目标是一个“大”范畴（category），见注记<REF_0001>。另一方面，<MATH_0007>是一个实际的数学对象（mathematical object）（即<SPACE_0001>一个集合（set）），比较注记<REF_0002>。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:a318bfe8d20febaf922bec63caf01dbafbadb1690b4fdc07d67afb4bfe706773", "unit_id": "tag:001L:prose-0004", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "本处范畴中的箭头；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "函子间的变换；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "natural transformation", "target_term": "自然变换"}, {"context": "复数函子；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "与态射合成；暂定译法。", "source_term": "composing", "target_term": "合成"}, {"context": "态射或变换的合成；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "composition", "target_term": "合成"}, {"context": "复数态射；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "前述函子间自然变换的简称；暂定译法。", "source_term": "transformations", "target_term": "变换"}, {"context": "Yoneda 函子；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "函子的目标范畴；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "实际的集合意义对象；暂定译法。", "source_term": "mathematical object", "target_term": "数学对象"}, {"context": "与大范畴区分的集合；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}]}
